  "goodToKnow": "Die Bauzeit is construction time: eine Bauzeit von drei Jahren. Big German projects are notorious for overruns: Berlin's BER airport (14 years), Hamburg's Elbphilharmonie (about ten years instead of three) and the rail project Stuttgart 21, begun in 2010, has faced years of delays. Cologne Cathedral holds the record: 632 years, from 1248 to 1880. Die Baustelle is a building site. Plural: die Bauzeiten."
